# cost_model_gate_d162.py:97 builds the fitted regressor over the interval t_submit to
# t_submit + first_token_s, summing intervals OPEN AT THE START INSTANT. That is submit-to-FIRST-
# TOKEN work, which is the D179 W quantity the coordinator already tracks. The model was therefore
# being fed a LARGER quantity than the one it was fitted on, which OVERESTIMATES the predicted
# first token and REFUSES WORK THAT WOULD HAVE FITTED.
